  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_ghost",
      "name": {
        "en": "Specter's Badge",
        "zh": "幽灵鲨证章",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "uniequip_001_ghost",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Specter has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for swift and fierce enemy suppression in combat.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Guard Operator during field operations to exercise Centurion responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员幽灵鲨擅长以凌厉攻势阻击敌人\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为近卫干员，行使强攻手职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_ghost",
      "name": {
        "en": "Dim Candlelight",
        "zh": "幽明烛光",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_ghost",
      "description": {
        "en": "Specter clutches the candle holder tight. She remembers it. But it should not be here.\nThe Medical Department operators visited her a moment ago. They pricked an ever-so-cautious drop of blood from her finger, then left her alone to recite prayer from her heart, liturgical meanings discerned by none. They tend to her body, attempt to heal her rended ego—they would not bestow her such a vile gift as this.\nShe touches the candlelight, but the fingertip feels no hint of warmth. A momentary lucidity and tranquility race ashore like foam. The edges of the waves wash over her throat cut wide open, and zealotry, scorched sun-dry in darkness, extinguishes its bellows. In the same moment, white flame climbs her wrist, sets her nun's habit alight, and leaps from her shoulder to sink into her sweeping hair.\nThrough the candlelight, she looks within. Laurentina stands before a statue. The Stygian sea encases a dome teeming with lights. The figure freed from raw stone lingers in her eyes, and its shadow chisels out an alcove. There, Laurentina lifts a machine to cut stone, a 'Little Handy' roving in circles beside her, swallowing up the fragments that pitter-patter against the floor.\nThrough the candlelight, she looks within. Rallying cries. Piercing whistles and sawblades all around as far as the eye can see, gristle and blood peeled from body, bones met together and fractured apart. The hunters born beneath domes are tearing apart the barriers of flesh now before them, their enemies falling to the seafloor as raindrops to the surface. A lance severs open a cavity; an incisive and clarion order; amidst ocean's currents Laurentina charges in. She hears singing.\nThrough the candlelight, she looks within. The statue behind the candle holder is virgin holy white, and when it weeps, it casts a shadow. She is sliced apart, to then be mended; sliced apart again, to then be mended again. Finally, they use Specter to slice apart Laurentina, and allow the seeds of dry land to root within her body. Thus, the sister kneels before the candle holder, grips her pendant tight, recites prayer from her heart, liturgical meanings discerned by none.\nThrough the candlelight, she looks within. The door to the treatment ward is pulled open. A familiar scent. A lithe yet firm echo of footsteps strikes down the candle holder, melting it into the lights of the corridor. Specter curls up, dreaming a peaceful dream so rare for her. In her dream, she burns atop the candle holder, as if she is its fourth flame.",
        "zh": "幽灵鲨紧握着烛台，她记得它，但它不应该出现在这里。\n医疗部的干员刚刚来过，他们小心翼翼地从她的指尖汲走了一滴血，留她独自一人默诵那些无人知晓含义的祷词。他们照料着她的身体，试图治愈她被撕裂的自我——他们不会赠予她这样一件恶毒的礼物。\n她触到了烛光，但指尖没有传来一丝温度。片刻的清醒和宁静如泡沫般涌上海岸，浪梢拂过被剖开胸腔、被暴晒在黑暗中的狂热，扑灭了它的嘶吼。与此同时，白色的火苗攀上她的手腕，点燃了修女服的衣袖，从肩头渗入她的长发。\n她透过烛光向内看，劳伦缇娜站在一尊雕像面前，黑暗的海洋包裹着盈满灯火的穹顶。从石块中被解放的形体驻留在她的眼中，它的阴影凿出了一间凹室。在那里，劳伦缇娜举起切削石料的机械，“小帮手”在一旁打着旋，吞下迸溅在地的碎屑。\n她透过烛光向内看，呐喊、尖啸与锯刃向四周蔓延，血肉剥离躯体，骨骼交错分离。出生在穹顶下的猎人正撕开面前的血肉壁垒，他们的敌手雨点般坠向海床。一柄长槊拨开空洞，一道锐利明晰的命令，劳伦缇娜在海流中突进，她听到了歌声。\n她透过烛光向内看，烛台后的那座雕像，圣洁的白色，它在垂泪时蒙上阴影。她被切开，然后愈合；再一次被切开，然后又一次愈合。最终，他们用幽灵鲨切开了劳伦缇娜，让陆地的种子在她的体内滋长。于是，修女跪在烛台前，紧握着吊坠，默诵那些无人知晓含义的祷词。\n她透过烛光向内看，医疗舱的门被拉开。一股熟悉的气味，一阵轻盈而坚硬的足音将烛台击落，融入走廊上的灯光。幽灵鲨蜷起身子，做着一场难得平静的梦。在梦里，她在烛台上燃烧着，像是它的第四根蜡烛。",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
